## Connectivity summary

The final edge table confirmed the intended model structure.

| Source | Target | Type |
|---|---|---|
| left A1 | left STG | Forward |
| right A1 | right STG | Forward |
| left STG | left IFG | Forward |
| right STG | right IFG | Forward |
| left STG | left A1 | Backward |
| right STG | right A1 | Backward |
| left IFG | left STG | Backward |
| right IFG | right STG | Backward |
| left IFG | right IFG | Lateral |
| right IFG | left IFG | Lateral |

In compact form, the structure is:

```text
left A1  <-> left STG  <-> left IFG
right A1 <-> right STG <-> right IFG
left IFG <-> right IFG
```

